  "game": "LE3",
  "targetMilanVersion": "0.0.0",
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-written illustrative slice, NOT generated output. Section paths and property names are",
    "taken from the ME3 originals, which LE3 MP inherits almost unchanged. `default` values are",
    "placeholders; a real bundle generates them from the game.",
    "",
    "It demonstrates:",
    "  1. class inheritance      - cooldowntime defined once on the power base class, cascaded",
    "  2. shared descriptions    - one text for cooldowntime, with a per-power addendum",
    "  3. a struct value         - (BaseValue=..,Formula=..,RankBonuses[0..n]=..)",
    "  4. a range as a struct    - (X=..f,Y=..f), two members, no special-case type",
    "  5. an optional inherited  - impactradius editable on the subclass, absent unless set",
    "  6. a repeated property  - enemy stats, once per difficulty, with a verbatim original",
    "",
    "Project keys are \"<classId>/<leafId>\" - cooldowntime is editable on every power, so Pull's",
    "and Singularity's need separate slots."
  ],
